  render_theorem(sec, "Kurtosis Universality", "For ALL 63 non-trivial idempotent projections in Z/12,612,600: excess kurtosis = -3/(2*k) where k = active channels. 63/63 = 100%. Z/2,310: only 16/31 match. Raising exponents heals the mod-2 deviation.");
