  render_p(sec, "2^3 NECESSITY: 2 gives Bernoulli (-2). 2^2 gives deviant (-1). 2^3=8 is the MINIMUM power for arcsine alignment. The mod-2 channel needs 2^3 before it matches the other channels. 4th moment threshold: need m > 4. 2^2=4 fails. 2^3=8 passes. Every ring names its own kurtosis: Z/210 = -1/2, Z/2,310 = -7/18, Z/12,612,600 = -3/(2*5).");
